WEBVTT

00:00:01.166 --> 00:00:06.036
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:07.066 --> 00:00:12.406
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:24.056 --> 00:00:29.326
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:30.056 --> 00:00:34.756
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.936 --> 00:00:41.196
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.736 --> 00:00:46.936
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:50.876
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.946 --> 00:00:56.046
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.686 --> 00:01:01.176
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.756 --> 00:01:08.716
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.796 --> 00:01:14.706
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tsuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.776 --> 00:01:21.336
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.616 --> 00:01:27.486
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:01:31.926 --> 00:01:33.686
You can run away, you know.

00:02:11.266 --> 00:02:12.926
Haseo...

00:02:43.526 --> 00:02:47.186
Was that the guy who killed
100 Player Killers in one go?

00:02:47.566 --> 00:02:50.626
You mean Haseo,
the "Terror of Death"?

00:02:50.966 --> 00:02:53.166
The name's a bit much.

00:02:53.236 --> 00:02:56.696
No harm will come to
those that stay out of it.

00:03:24.906 --> 00:03:25.956
Master Yata!

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:28.866
It's Ovan...

00:03:28.936 --> 00:03:30.336
He's made a move.

00:03:31.476 --> 00:03:33.036
So he's back.

00:03:43.016 --> 00:03:44.146
Who is that?

00:03:46.186 --> 00:03:47.916
Someone we're watching.

00:04:05.276 --> 00:04:08.036
How long do you plan to
keep coming here?

00:04:08.116 --> 00:04:10.516
Until you disclose some
insider information.

00:04:10.576 --> 00:04:11.776
How's that?

00:04:11.846 --> 00:04:14.006
I'm not an informant.

00:04:14.916 --> 00:04:16.146
I was kidding.

00:04:16.216 --> 00:04:18.746
I like hanging out here
because it's comfortable.

00:04:19.186 --> 00:04:20.956
How bothersome.

00:04:22.326 --> 00:04:25.786
I wonder why
Haseo stopped coming here.

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:30.296
I'm sure he has his reasons.

00:04:31.166 --> 00:04:32.096
Yeah, but...

00:04:32.166 --> 00:04:35.796
They're calling him
the "Terror of Death".

00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:40.746
I guess he can't turn back now.

00:04:42.476 --> 00:04:44.176
Of course he can.

00:04:44.246 --> 00:04:45.806
As many times as he wants.

00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:53.946
He's got another chance
if he's willing to take it.

00:04:54.526 --> 00:04:58.256
Not just in the game,
but also in the real world.

00:04:59.366 --> 00:05:01.696
Willing to take it, huh?

00:05:03.936 --> 00:05:05.696
I wonder if he will...

00:05:05.766 --> 00:05:06.896
...take the chance.

00:05:23.786 --> 00:05:25.756
It's all because...

00:05:25.826 --> 00:05:27.656
...Shino became a Lost One.

00:05:39.636 --> 00:05:43.466
Are you still planning
on supporting Haseo like this?

00:05:45.646 --> 00:05:47.666
I'm sorry, I...

00:05:47.746 --> 00:05:49.306
I don't want a Papa like that!

00:05:51.316 --> 00:05:55.516
I don't think I can continue to
help him either.

00:05:56.016 --> 00:05:57.176
But...

00:05:58.226 --> 00:06:00.916
But I think supporting Haseo...

00:06:00.986 --> 00:06:02.016
Enough.

00:06:02.896 --> 00:06:03.916
Let's go!

00:06:20.176 --> 00:06:23.266
I guess Haseo must be
the way he is...

00:06:23.416 --> 00:06:25.476
...because Shino became
a Lost One.

00:06:26.116 --> 00:06:27.086
I'm sure.

00:06:34.856 --> 00:06:36.616
It's been awhile!

00:06:36.696 --> 00:06:37.956
Saburou!

00:06:38.396 --> 00:06:42.026
I thought you'd be here,
so I stopped by.

00:06:43.336 --> 00:06:44.296
I see.

00:06:45.366 --> 00:06:46.766
This is not like you at all.

00:06:47.806 --> 00:06:48.926
Well...

00:06:50.136 --> 00:06:53.736
There was this dog that would
always bark on my way to school.

00:06:54.246 --> 00:06:56.216
He was so annoying.

00:06:56.276 --> 00:06:59.116
But when he was gone
and it was quiet again...

00:06:59.186 --> 00:07:02.206
...I felt sad instead of being relieved.

00:07:02.986 --> 00:07:05.176
That's what it feels like.

00:07:06.626 --> 00:07:09.086
Am I a dog?

00:07:09.156 --> 00:07:10.956
I guess you're a cat here.

00:07:11.526 --> 00:07:12.456
What's that?

00:07:13.126 --> 00:07:15.856
By the way, I heard some rumors
at Mac Anu.

00:07:16.566 --> 00:07:18.696
But I'd take them
all with a grain of salt.

00:07:18.766 --> 00:07:21.566
They're probably all true.

00:07:22.406 --> 00:07:24.376
Maybe, but come on...

00:07:24.436 --> 00:07:26.966
What good is it
if you keep moping around?

00:07:27.046 --> 00:07:28.506
I'm not moping.

00:07:30.446 --> 00:07:33.146
Haseo's actually really kind.

00:07:34.046 --> 00:07:38.416
That's why I can't decide
what to do about him.

00:07:38.756 --> 00:07:39.986
Kind?

00:07:40.386 --> 00:07:41.516
Haseo is?

00:07:42.756 --> 00:07:46.716
He often goes to the
Hulle Granz Cathedral.

00:07:46.796 --> 00:07:47.766
Oh?

00:07:47.826 --> 00:07:50.426
I think he goes there to pray.

00:07:50.796 --> 00:07:52.136
Because it's a church?

00:07:52.466 --> 00:07:53.626
No.

00:07:53.706 --> 00:07:56.506
For Haseo, that place is...

00:07:56.576 --> 00:07:58.126
...very special to him.

00:07:58.806 --> 00:08:01.976
And I hardly go there at all.

00:08:02.046 --> 00:08:03.876
He goes there everyday?

00:08:03.946 --> 00:08:05.136
I don't know.

00:08:05.216 --> 00:08:08.586
But he goes there
every time he's logged in.

00:08:08.986 --> 00:08:10.476
I never would've thought.

00:08:11.526 --> 00:08:13.576
Haseo's kind.

00:08:13.656 --> 00:08:16.646
He's always thinking of Shino.

00:08:16.996 --> 00:08:17.956
Shino?

00:08:18.526 --> 00:08:19.426
Sorry.

00:08:19.496 --> 00:08:21.056
I guess you don't know her.

00:08:22.296 --> 00:08:25.396
Haseo's the way he is
because of her.

00:08:27.566 --> 00:08:29.536
I don't know what happened...

00:08:29.606 --> 00:08:32.336
...but right now I think
he just wants to get stronger.

00:08:32.406 --> 00:08:33.736
That's not true!

00:08:34.676 --> 00:08:37.806
I know Haseo's doing all this
for Shino!

00:08:38.546 --> 00:08:40.136
Then, what about you?

00:08:41.586 --> 00:08:42.556
Me?

00:08:44.556 --> 00:08:48.016
Aren't you doing anything
for Shino?

00:08:52.296 --> 00:08:53.656
I see.

00:08:53.726 --> 00:08:55.626
So you're not doing anything.

00:08:55.696 --> 00:08:57.066
Well...

00:09:21.556 --> 00:09:22.616
Wait!

00:09:23.226 --> 00:09:25.426
You sure you're okay with this?

00:09:27.596 --> 00:09:31.226
Have you considered
what Shino would think...

00:09:31.296 --> 00:09:33.396
...about you being called
the "Terror of Death"?

00:09:34.806 --> 00:09:38.266
He's not the kind of opponent you
can defeat with just your strength.

00:09:38.346 --> 00:09:40.576
Tri-Edge is on an entirely
different level.

00:09:40.876 --> 00:09:44.606
It's no use to try to beat him.

00:09:44.676 --> 00:09:50.146
No matter how strong you get,
you're still no match for Tri-Edge.

00:09:50.856 --> 00:09:51.976
That's why Shino...

00:09:52.056 --> 00:09:54.316
It doesn't matter what Shino thinks!

00:09:55.296 --> 00:09:57.346
You really believe that?

00:09:57.856 --> 00:09:59.796
I'm going to save Shino!

00:09:59.866 --> 00:10:01.696
I'll deal with your criticism later!

00:10:03.236 --> 00:10:04.666
Listen to me!

00:10:15.946 --> 00:10:17.776
We should just do our own thing.

00:10:18.146 --> 00:10:19.516
That's all we need.

00:10:22.356 --> 00:10:25.376
She wasn't that type of girl
to begin with.

00:10:25.456 --> 00:10:26.646
Just get over it.

00:10:28.256 --> 00:10:30.086
It isn't really like that.

00:10:31.356 --> 00:10:33.916
I went along with your idea...

00:10:34.466 --> 00:10:37.896
...about starting a Guild to help
beginners and intermediates.

00:10:39.236 --> 00:10:40.366
That's right.

00:10:40.436 --> 00:10:42.166
But not her.

00:10:42.536 --> 00:10:44.906
All she wanted was to help
the "Terror of Death"!

00:10:46.476 --> 00:10:48.166
Well, I'm determined to do it.

00:10:48.246 --> 00:10:50.436
I'm not ending things half way
like this.

00:10:52.346 --> 00:10:53.576
I guess you're right.

00:10:54.516 --> 00:10:55.816
Even just by myself...

00:10:55.886 --> 00:10:59.146
No, the two of us.
Think we could start it up again?

00:11:18.646 --> 00:11:19.666
What's going on?

00:11:19.746 --> 00:11:22.576
It's an argument between
the Moon Tree Guild's Sakaki...

00:11:22.646 --> 00:11:24.206
...and Haseo, the "Terror of Death".

00:11:24.416 --> 00:11:26.606
That's like mixing water and oil!

00:11:26.686 --> 00:11:29.116
Moon Tree hates PKs, right?

00:11:29.486 --> 00:11:30.646
Let's go check it out!

00:11:35.856 --> 00:11:38.386
I'm just useless.

00:11:46.166 --> 00:11:47.156
Phyllo?

00:11:49.476 --> 00:11:51.096
Phyllo! Where were you?

00:11:51.636 --> 00:11:54.306
Sorry, my cat and dog
were wreaking havoc...

00:11:54.376 --> 00:11:55.636
...and the plug...

00:11:55.716 --> 00:11:57.206
Never mind that!

00:11:57.276 --> 00:11:58.906
Haseo's over there!

00:11:59.446 --> 00:12:00.816
You met him?

00:12:01.116 --> 00:12:02.016
No!

00:12:02.086 --> 00:12:04.346
I heard he was fighting someone
in the plaza!

00:12:57.406 --> 00:12:58.566
Almost time.

00:13:05.846 --> 00:13:06.816
Ovan!

00:13:07.816 --> 00:13:09.306
Hey! You running away?!

00:13:22.996 --> 00:13:24.126
Haseo...

00:13:34.976 --> 00:13:36.106
Ovan!

00:13:40.346 --> 00:13:42.546
It's been a while, Haseo.

00:13:43.556 --> 00:13:46.786
Or maybe I should call you
the "Terror of Death"?

00:13:49.896 --> 00:13:51.856
You've gotten quite strong.

00:13:52.266 --> 00:13:54.786
Much stronger than before.

00:13:56.566 --> 00:13:57.626
Yeah.

00:13:57.696 --> 00:13:59.596
Just as you hoped.

00:14:00.266 --> 00:14:01.466
Haseo.

00:14:01.536 --> 00:14:04.096
You always meet my expectations.

00:14:04.576 --> 00:14:08.136
You didn't come back when
the Twilight Brigade broke up.

00:14:08.306 --> 00:14:11.606
What have you been doing
for the last six months?

00:14:15.486 --> 00:14:19.046
When you suddenly disappeared,
we all just...

00:14:20.386 --> 00:14:22.686
Why did you disappear like that?

00:14:23.896 --> 00:14:26.196
We were all waiting for you.

00:14:26.266 --> 00:14:29.166
At the very least, Shino and I...

00:14:29.236 --> 00:14:32.756
...believed you were coming back.

00:14:40.906 --> 00:14:44.246
After that, Shino...

00:14:57.696 --> 00:15:00.956
You want to know about Tri-Edge?

00:15:03.636 --> 00:15:05.466
You saw Ovan?

00:15:06.106 --> 00:15:08.836
There's no other character
like that.

00:15:09.276 --> 00:15:11.326
No one's seen him
for a long time.

00:15:12.606 --> 00:15:15.596
He was watching Haseo fighting.

00:15:15.676 --> 00:15:16.976
Haseo was there too?

00:15:18.276 --> 00:15:21.446
As soon as he spotted Ovan,
Haseo just took off after him.

00:15:22.016 --> 00:15:23.316
Where'd he go?

00:15:23.556 --> 00:15:24.516
I don't know.

00:15:24.586 --> 00:15:28.786
But someone said they saw Ovan
at the Hulle Granz Cathedral.

00:15:28.856 --> 00:15:30.016
When?

00:15:30.096 --> 00:15:31.256
Just now, I think.

00:15:31.856 --> 00:15:33.826
Apparently he was praying.

00:15:39.036 --> 00:15:42.236
He will be back today.

00:15:44.306 --> 00:15:45.496
Can you guess where?

00:15:46.746 --> 00:15:48.866
At the Hulle Granz Cathedral?!

00:15:49.146 --> 00:15:50.116
Right.

00:15:50.876 --> 00:15:52.746
The place where Shino was killed.

00:15:54.416 --> 00:15:57.406
Tri-Edge is coming back!

00:16:00.126 --> 00:16:01.526
Finally!

00:16:01.586 --> 00:16:03.116
Finally, with these hands!

00:16:08.426 --> 00:16:11.456
I swear I'll bring Shino back!

00:16:13.306 --> 00:16:14.996
Right, Ovan?

00:16:16.006 --> 00:16:16.936
Yes.

00:16:17.006 --> 00:16:19.666
It's something that
only we can do.

00:16:21.106 --> 00:16:22.876
Only we can do...

00:16:25.816 --> 00:16:26.876
Ovan?

00:16:27.246 --> 00:16:28.376
I'll go on ahead.

00:16:29.256 --> 00:16:31.086
I'll meet you at the cathedral.

00:17:00.286 --> 00:17:03.916
Is there anything I can do?

00:17:13.426 --> 00:17:17.726
If you were offered the seed of happiness

00:17:20.966 --> 00:17:24.496
By an angel that lives in hell

00:17:24.576 --> 00:17:28.566
What would you do?

00:17:28.646 --> 00:17:31.246
Unfortunate person

00:17:31.246 --> 00:17:33.676
Unfortunate person
Did he really come here to pray?

00:17:36.316 --> 00:17:39.916
I can sell you a magnificent
tragedy cheaply

00:17:39.986 --> 00:17:43.926
Would you care to try it?

00:17:44.126 --> 00:17:47.896
Even if you fell into an unpredictable trap

00:17:47.966 --> 00:17:51.866
Would you still believe

00:17:51.936 --> 00:17:54.666
The skillful lawyers

00:17:54.666 --> 00:17:55.806
The skillful lawyers
Can I stay like this for a moment?

00:17:55.806 --> 00:17:55.836
Can I stay like this for a moment?

00:17:55.836 --> 00:17:57.606
Will come and help?
Can I stay like this for a moment?

00:17:57.606 --> 00:17:59.336
Will come and help?

00:17:59.406 --> 00:18:03.206
Welcome. Welcome.
This is a place of salvation

00:18:03.276 --> 00:18:07.006
Just be silent
And entrust yourself to it

00:18:07.086 --> 00:18:10.846
Forget it. Forget it.
The confusion of this world

00:18:10.916 --> 00:18:14.756
As you walk the path you desire
It's a rose colored catastrophe

00:18:20.896 --> 00:18:21.866
Shino...

00:18:30.376 --> 00:18:31.536
What is this?

00:18:43.716 --> 00:18:47.746
A lackluster reality

00:18:51.196 --> 00:18:58.866
And inhuman lust on the stage of life
It's a sold out show

00:18:59.136 --> 00:19:01.696
Someone else's misfortune

00:19:01.766 --> 00:19:04.936
Tastes like honey that drips cruelly

00:19:04.936 --> 00:19:06.046
Tastes like honey that drips cruelly
What the...?!

00:19:06.046 --> 00:19:06.076
Tastes like honey that drips cruelly

00:19:06.076 --> 00:19:06.906
Tastes like honey that drips cruelly
Master Yata!

00:19:06.906 --> 00:19:06.946
Master Yata!

00:19:06.946 --> 00:19:07.146
Did you think it wouldn't
Master Yata!

00:19:07.146 --> 00:19:07.646
Did you think it wouldn't

00:19:07.646 --> 00:19:09.446
Did you think it wouldn't
There's an anomaly
in the cathedral!

00:19:09.446 --> 00:19:10.276
Did you think it wouldn't

00:19:10.276 --> 00:19:10.816
Did you think it wouldn't
Bastard!

00:19:10.816 --> 00:19:10.846
Bastard!

00:19:10.846 --> 00:19:11.376
Ever happen to you?
Bastard!

00:19:11.376 --> 00:19:13.586
Ever happen to you?

00:19:13.586 --> 00:19:14.246
Ever happen to you?
Die!

00:19:14.246 --> 00:19:14.286
Die!

00:19:14.286 --> 00:19:14.686
Welcome. Welcome.
Take some blood from paradise
Die!

00:19:14.686 --> 00:19:18.046
Welcome. Welcome.
Take some blood from paradise

00:19:18.116 --> 00:19:21.786
All you have to do is lower your eyes
And reach out your arms

00:19:21.856 --> 00:19:25.756
Dream. Dream.
At the depth of afterlife

00:19:25.826 --> 00:19:29.556
As you are split by a needlepoint
The moribundity of a tragicomedy

00:19:39.106 --> 00:19:42.376
I should've tried to
get his attention.

00:19:42.916 --> 00:19:46.406
If you're feeling regret
then you should have tried harder.

00:19:47.416 --> 00:19:51.716
I wonder if Haseo has really
become the Terror of Death.

00:19:51.786 --> 00:19:53.186
It doesn't matter.

00:19:53.256 --> 00:19:58.416
You must realize that you're
the only one that can stop Haseo now.

00:19:58.996 --> 00:20:00.756
Take that to heart.

00:20:01.926 --> 00:20:03.596
Only me?

00:20:06.136 --> 00:20:07.436
You too, right?

00:20:09.436 --> 00:20:10.496
Am I wrong?

00:20:11.136 --> 00:20:14.976
My words don't
get through to him anymore.

00:20:15.846 --> 00:20:18.606
It's the same with me.

00:20:19.186 --> 00:20:20.736
They get through.

00:20:20.986 --> 00:20:25.516
That's why he runs away
from you all of the time.

00:20:41.766 --> 00:20:43.466
What's happening?

00:20:46.576 --> 00:20:50.136
It seems that
Haseo's battle with Tri-Edge...

00:20:50.216 --> 00:20:51.906
...has altered his data.

00:20:51.976 --> 00:20:53.246
Has he been awakened?

00:20:56.516 --> 00:20:57.576
Not yet.

00:20:58.926 --> 00:21:01.286
What is this?

00:21:01.856 --> 00:21:03.586
He's been initialized?

00:21:03.726 --> 00:21:05.526
Perhaps he's being data drained.

00:21:05.596 --> 00:21:07.066
What's going on?!

00:21:07.126 --> 00:21:08.596
You shut up!

00:21:38.226 --> 00:21:39.696
Did you just see that, too?

00:21:40.526 --> 00:21:42.756
No. I saw nothing.

00:21:43.296 --> 00:21:45.356
What?
What happened here?

00:21:46.906 --> 00:21:48.066
Haseo was...

00:21:53.376 --> 00:21:54.306
Y'know...

00:21:54.376 --> 00:21:59.146
When so many things happen,
it all gets really confusing.

00:21:59.816 --> 00:22:00.876
It's true.

00:22:01.946 --> 00:22:03.106
Take it easy.

00:22:03.386 --> 00:22:04.906
What happened to Haseo?

00:22:09.696 --> 00:22:10.716
He's been erased.

00:22:11.326 --> 00:22:12.416
What?!

00:22:30.246 --> 00:22:33.836
Ikiru wa dokuhai kiyu no kurushimi wo
Life is a poisoned cup of needless suffering

00:22:33.916 --> 00:22:37.356
Nomihosu sube wo dare ga sazukeyo
That no one can show me how to drain

00:22:37.616 --> 00:22:41.016
Taiyo ni sumu toiu kenja no washi
A wise eagle is said to live in the sun

00:22:41.086 --> 00:22:45.456
Habataki dake ga kodama suru
The flapping of its wings
is all that echoes

00:22:48.966 --> 00:22:52.496
Kono futatsu no me ni yadotta
In each of these eyes

00:22:52.566 --> 00:22:56.266
Yami to Hikari sono docchi de
Dwell darkness and light

00:22:56.336 --> 00:23:03.576
Boku wa ashita wo mitsumeru
beki nano darou
Through which shall I look to tomorrow?

00:23:03.646 --> 00:23:07.306
Kawaki kitta gareki no machi
A dried out and ruined city

00:23:07.386 --> 00:23:11.076
Ten to sen wo tsunagi awase
Draws the lines between the dots

00:23:11.156 --> 00:23:18.086
Imi nado nai koto bakari afurete iku
Causing meaningless events to overflow

00:23:18.256 --> 00:23:21.926
Honou no gotoki kodoku
Soothing the loneliness

00:23:21.996 --> 00:23:25.026
Idaku karada shizumete wa
That flames up within the body

00:23:25.096 --> 00:23:32.636
Ankyo eto shitatatte iku shizuku
Droplets of water fall towards the culvert

00:23:32.876 --> 00:23:36.366
Kakageru dokuhai kono sei wa michitemo
Even if the poisoned cup is upheld
and filled with this life

00:23:36.476 --> 00:23:40.176
Kogareru shino yume wa nagare tsuku
My dream that yearns for death
drifts into it

00:23:40.386 --> 00:23:43.816
Toride ni kuikomu tsume kokou no washi
The eagle remains aloof;
its talons dig into the fort

00:23:43.886 --> 00:23:47.516
Habataki dake ga maiagaru
Only the flapping of its wings resounds

00:23:47.586 --> 00:23:51.316
Ano soukyu ni takkei ni shite kure tamae
Let me be crucified in the blue sky

00:23:51.396 --> 00:23:54.756
Ten to chi ga musubu basho ni
bokuwa tatsu
I'll stand where heaven and earth meet

00:23:55.966 --> 00:23:56.936
Next Episode
